  "geminiNoteTerms": "Quincena uses Gemini on Google Cloud's Agent Platform, as a paying customer: Google does not train its models on what is sent or keep it in a cache, and only holds on to a question its filters flag as abuse. Even so, do not write in a question anything you would not share, such as an account number.",
